  "description": "Email login and authentication for ASP.NET Core and OpenIddict. Add passwordless login by email to your website or app over standard OpenID Connect (OIDC): a magic link with a QR code, or the one-tap email — the user sends a pre-filled email with one tap, nothing to type. Over SMTP, with inbound email from a provider webhook or IMAP; for users without a messaging app. Veriqa channel adapter (satellite package).",
